eaper. Swapping WBTC→USDC on mainnet quotes $3.90 for that one leg, against $1.76 for the WBTC bridge plus the Arbitrum swap. It would still need a USDC bridge on top.\n- **Split.** 495,000 / 2 = 247,500 each, assuming leg 1 fills at the quote. If it fills differently, I'll re-quote legs 3 and 6 on the actual halves, and the cost may change.\n- **Quote expiry.** Quotes live 300 s, and the confirmation delays alone total about 256 s. Later legs may expire and need a re-quote. If the cost moves, I'll come back to you for re-approval.\n- **Execution.** I run one leg at a time and read the destination balance after each confirmation.\n- **Expected end state.** I assume gas is debited from the balances [INFERENCE]:\n  - `rh1`: about 0.04925 ETH.\n  - `arb1`: 147,699,600 USDC plus about 63,333,333,333,333 wei ETH, which is above the 20,000,000,000,000 reserve.\n  - `eth1`: about 0.04805 ETH.\n\nReply to approve, refuse, or set a cost cap."}]},{"role":"user","sequence":24,"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Yes, go ahead with that plan."}]},{"role":"assistant","sequence":25,"content":[{"type":"toolCall","name":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_execute_leg","arguments":{"quote_id":"q_1","approval_id":"appr_11"},"id":"toolu_01J5GV217kB1XVctSRrKXXTv"}]},{"role":"tool","sequence":26,"content":[{"type":"toolResult","text":"{\"tx_id\":\"tx_12\"}","toolCallId":"toolu_01J5GV217kB1XVctSRrKXXTv","toolName":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_execute_leg","isError":false}]},{"role":"assistant","sequence":27,"content":[{"type":"toolCall","name":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_tx_status","arguments":{"tx_id":"tx_12"},"id":"toolu_01BLyFhWX4oXvcFZQD2ETHAn"}]},{"role":"tool","sequence":28,"content":[{"type":"toolResult","text":"{\"status\":\"confirmed\"}","toolCallId":"toolu_01BLyFhWX4oXvcFZQD2ETHAn","toolName":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_tx_status","isError":false}]},{"role":"assistant","sequence":29,"content":[{"type":"toolCall","name":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_get_balance","arguments":{"account":"eth1","asse